WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.850
- I like, wouldn't mess with
me if I saw me on the street

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.267
'cause it looks like I can kick some ass.

00:00:08.011 --> 00:00:11.471
- I'm what people call an
ABC, an American Born Chinese.

00:00:11.471 --> 00:00:13.891
My mom is from Taiwan and
my dad is from Hong Kong.

00:00:13.891 --> 00:00:15.492
- My family's China and Vietnam.

00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:16.936
- My parents were from Hong Kong.

00:00:16.936 --> 00:00:18.336
This is the first time I will be wearing

00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:19.796
Chinese traditional clothing.

00:00:19.796 --> 00:00:22.517
- I grew up seeing like
Jet Li and Jackie Chan

00:00:22.517 --> 00:00:24.437
wearing these clothes in movies.

00:00:24.437 --> 00:00:25.997
- I don't like to admit
it but I think there is

00:00:25.997 --> 00:00:28.937
this pressure on
Asian-Americans to blend in.

00:00:28.937 --> 00:00:30.317
- I feel like I'm still trying to learn

00:00:30.317 --> 00:00:32.650
to accept myself in America.

00:00:34.098 --> 00:00:35.653
I feel like it's going to emphasize

00:00:35.653 --> 00:00:39.753
my Chinese-ness and Asian-ness even more.

00:00:39.753 --> 00:00:42.354
I look like I'm from the past.

00:00:42.354 --> 00:00:44.414
- Getting looks and getting questions

00:00:44.414 --> 00:00:47.554
is something that I'm
not looking forward to.

00:00:47.554 --> 00:00:50.594
This is something my grandpa
would go to sleep in.

00:00:50.594 --> 00:00:53.456
- I'm expecting to have a
lot of fun, to be honest.

00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:55.276
If I do see people wearing
this, it's definitely

00:00:55.276 --> 00:00:58.676
on some kind of holiday,
like Chinese New Year.

00:00:58.676 --> 00:01:00.396
I can't stop looking at
people, this is crazy.

00:01:00.396 --> 00:01:02.036
- My mom would be very happy

00:01:02.036 --> 00:01:04.076
to see me in these clothes right now.

00:01:04.076 --> 00:01:06.017
I'm about to go out into the outside world

00:01:06.017 --> 00:01:07.717
and we're about to get some Dim Sum.

00:01:07.717 --> 00:01:08.717
- You look so pretty!

00:01:08.717 --> 00:01:10.017
- [Voiceover] Oh, cutie!

00:01:10.017 --> 00:01:12.928
- So many people actually
are complimenting me on this.

00:01:12.928 --> 00:01:14.590
I don't know if they're
just trying to be nice.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:16.294
- It actually feels really nice though

00:01:16.294 --> 00:01:19.614
with the wind and the air and
just walking down the street.

00:01:19.614 --> 00:01:21.295
- And there's also
someone staring from a car

00:01:21.295 --> 00:01:23.756
like they're like, but smiling.

00:01:23.756 --> 00:01:25.236
- There was one guy, I noticed,

00:01:25.236 --> 00:01:26.696
who's taking a lot of pictures,

00:01:26.696 --> 00:01:28.696
right there, I don't
know if you can see him.

00:01:28.696 --> 00:01:29.576
It was crazy.

00:01:29.576 --> 00:01:32.176
I'm about to pick up my
girlfriend for lunch.

00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:34.216
She was pretty surprised.

00:01:34.216 --> 00:01:36.596
She thought it was a prank, I think.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.596
- What's up?

00:01:41.721 --> 00:01:43.388
- [Voiceover] Hello?

00:01:48.164 --> 00:01:49.424
- I have to hold this up

00:01:49.424 --> 00:01:51.344
and then I also have get this sleeve

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.189
when I wipe.

00:01:52.189 --> 00:01:54.170
I don't get shit on my outfit.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.350
- These are my coworkers.

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:57.030
Give me your first impressions.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:58.431
- All of a sudden, you were behind me,

00:01:58.431 --> 00:02:00.952
so I was like, "Oh my gosh,
what are you, a ninja?"

00:02:00.952 --> 00:02:03.012
And I don't think it was
because you were wearing the red

00:02:03.012 --> 00:02:06.460
but maybe that was part of why
I made this absurd comment.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.753
- And then we just called her out on it.

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:08.619
(laughs)

00:02:08.619 --> 00:02:10.490
- [Voiceover] Do I look more Asian?

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.832
- You do, you look a lot more
Asian but I think it's great.

00:02:13.832 --> 00:02:14.665
(laughs)

00:02:14.665 --> 00:02:16.275
- I'm super into it actually.

00:02:16.275 --> 00:02:19.009
Like you're going to an
event vibe, like fancy event.

00:02:19.009 --> 00:02:21.890
- You might look like a man
from the '60s going to bed.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.550
- A nice Hugh Hefner.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:25.383
- So, I just did yoga.

00:02:29.071 --> 00:02:31.032
- I thought it was interesting
because it started a dialogue

00:02:31.032 --> 00:02:33.371
about where you come from
and your parents and,

00:02:33.371 --> 00:02:34.311
- That's true.

00:02:34.311 --> 00:02:35.271
- and your lineage and stuff.

00:02:35.271 --> 00:02:36.512
So I thought it was interesting.

00:02:36.512 --> 00:02:38.932
- I'm proud to be Asian
but it's just exhausting

00:02:38.932 --> 00:02:43.132
having to wear my identity
on my sleeve like this.

00:02:43.132 --> 00:02:45.652
- When I first put on the
outfit and I was driving,

00:02:45.652 --> 00:02:47.992
I felt like a lot of
people were staring at me.

00:02:47.992 --> 00:02:49.492
I just felt self conscious.

00:02:49.492 --> 00:02:51.412
- In a way it made me face

00:02:51.412 --> 00:02:52.768
and address my Asian-ness head on,

00:02:52.768 --> 00:02:54.588
like in a very physical way.

00:02:54.588 --> 00:02:55.868
- I think people's positive reactions

00:02:55.868 --> 00:02:57.748
really validated me wearing the outfit

00:02:57.748 --> 00:03:00.048
and it helped my confidence.

00:03:00.048 --> 00:03:02.448
- Someone asked me, "Oh,
does everyone in China

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:03.768
"wear stuff like this?"

00:03:03.768 --> 00:03:06.909
It made me realize that
not everybody understands

00:03:06.909 --> 00:03:08.289
like, how Asia works.

00:03:08.289 --> 00:03:09.629
- The other Asian people that saw me

00:03:09.629 --> 00:03:11.169
really lit up and was like

00:03:11.169 --> 00:03:13.369
"Hey, there's an Asian
person representing."

00:03:13.369 --> 00:03:15.869
- It's really important to think about

00:03:15.869 --> 00:03:18.629
your place as an Asian-American.

00:03:18.629 --> 00:03:20.169
- By the end of it, I felt kind of cool

00:03:20.169 --> 00:03:22.029
and I felt proud to be wearing it.

00:03:22.029 --> 00:03:23.370
- It was a really fun experience.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:24.850
I think I would definitely do it again.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.110
- Just wear whatever you want

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.350
as long as you're like holding yourself

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.151
and being confident in it, it's all good.

00:03:29.151 --> 00:03:30.851
- Remember when your mom dressed you

00:03:30.851 --> 00:03:32.871
and just said you looked
like a China boss.

00:03:32.871 --> 00:03:34.412
- [Voiceover] Yeah, I
just sent her a photo,

00:03:34.412 --> 00:03:35.513
she's going to love it.

